   755	        AND the same confirmation policy as any action. A command that would
   756	        normally require confirmation is refused here (we don't silently run a
   757	        gated command as a 'verification') — the agent is told to run it as an
   758	        ordinary, gated action first. Ordinary test/build/lint checks assess as
   759	        MEDIUM and run unimpeded. Returns (passed, malformed): `passed` is True
   760	        iff the check ran and passed; `malformed` is True iff the verify command
   761	        itself is broken (command-not-found / SyntaxError) rather than the task."""
